{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15352","headline":"送客赴江陵寄郢州郎士元 · 李端","name":"送客赴江陵寄郢州郎士元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露下晚蝉愁，诗人旧怨秋。\n沅湘莫留滞，宛洛好遨游。\n饮马逢黄菊，离家值白头。\n竟陵明月夜，爲上庾公楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}